    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38874" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιβάθρα</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ladder</i> or <i>steps to ascend
				by: scaling ladder</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				91.48
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.Mech.
				25.3
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				7.9.2
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>An.</u>
				4.27.1
			</span></i>; <i>ship's ladder, gangway</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				12.62
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. metaph.,
				<i>means of approach, stepping-stone</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.24.14
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἔχειν τὴν Ἄβυδον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					16.29.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάμον ἐ. τισὶ γενέσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					11.8.2
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς Ἑλλάδος</span>
			<i>towards . . </i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Demetr.</u>
				8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ ἑξῆς</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					1.7.22
