					Gal.
					9.149
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>.
			<i>platform</i> for engines of war, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
