			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεῦσις ἐ. τῶν αἰσθήσεων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.665
				</span></i>
			.</div>
